{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Actuator : Overt Abnormality&quot; is a new action RPG that expands your horizons as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, in search of a certain rare battery, arrives at a peculiar town\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town seems to be strange, with violent creatures and no sign of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist uses his natural athletic ability to confront the anomaly alone. (all while continuing their search for the battery)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaulting Jump</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is athletic and can jump over places that are slightly taller than she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/86b4b909f8da32ea9dd894e0f9020efe.poster.avif?t=1760077995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/86b4b909f8da32ea9dd894e0f9020efe.webm?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/86b4b909f8da32ea9dd894e0f9020efe.mp4?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actuator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious flashlight that the protagonist always carries in her hand can move any \u201cobject\u201d at will from a distance, as long as the conditions are met.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/578b950565678c155f6b6079d7c00058.poster.avif?t=1760077995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/578b950565678c155f6b6079d7c00058.webm?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/578b950565678c155f6b6079d7c00058.mp4?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PlayerLevel</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an enemy, you gain experience, and when that experience exceeds a certain number, your player level increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your player level increases, your field of vision becomes wider and you can see more things, for example, you can detect the habits of enemies before they attack and avoid their attacks, and it becomes easier to find buildings that are hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the higher the level, the harder it will be to find small objects, so you may have a hard time defeating enemies that you casually defeated in the beginning of the game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/2b8e28d57bc0a6fa8bde0cb8eecac571.poster.avif?t=1760077995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/2b8e28d57bc0a6fa8bde0cb8eecac571.webm?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/2b8e28d57bc0a6fa8bde0cb8eecac571.mp4?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game has not been localized into languages other than Japanese at this stage of development, but we are working on translating the game for release!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703440?t=1760077995","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703440?t=1760077995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/b4d9dd7126d1d1ea54ee8c6d124bc5ae5f88542f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760077995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/b4d9dd7126d1d1ea54ee8c6d124bc5ae5f88542f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760077995","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Notice</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is still under development. By the time of release, the visuals and movements will be polished to an even higher level(We plan to replace the videos and images on the page with the final visuals by the time of release.)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Update on the Release \u2013 October 2025</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game only supports Japanese, but we are preparing to localize the game into other languages for release!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Actuator : Overt Abnormality&quot; is a new action RPG that expands your horizons as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, in search of a certain rare battery, arrives at a peculiar town\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town seems to be strange, with violent creatures and no sign of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist uses his natural athletic ability to confront the anomaly alone. (all while continuing their search for the battery)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaulting Jump</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is athletic and can jump over places that are slightly taller than she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/86b4b909f8da32ea9dd894e0f9020efe.poster.avif?t=1760077995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/86b4b909f8da32ea9dd894e0f9020efe.webm?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/86b4b909f8da32ea9dd894e0f9020efe.mp4?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actuator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious flashlight that the protagonist always carries in her hand can move any \u201cobject\u201d at will from a distance, as long as the conditions are met.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/578b950565678c155f6b6079d7c00058.poster.avif?t=1760077995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/578b950565678c155f6b6079d7c00058.webm?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/578b950565678c155f6b6079d7c00058.mp4?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PlayerLevel</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an enemy, you gain experience, and when that experience exceeds a certain number, your player level increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your player level increases, your field of vision becomes wider and you can see more things, for example, you can detect the habits of enemies before they attack and avoid their attacks, and it becomes easier to find buildings that are hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the higher the level, the harder it will be to find small objects, so you may have a hard time defeating enemies that you casually defeated in the beginning of the game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/2b8e28d57bc0a6fa8bde0cb8eecac571.poster.avif?t=1760077995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/2b8e28d57bc0a6fa8bde0cb8eecac571.webm?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/extras/2b8e28d57bc0a6fa8bde0cb8eecac571.mp4?t=1760077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game has not been localized into languages other than Japanese at this stage of development, but we are working on translating the game for release!</strong></p>","developers":["Paguon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703440/532a74897098c321c57bee94d3d2af359abf905d/header.jpg?t=1760077995","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703440/881888/148410363d7e6c7959ae816a09ca8295462b5534/1750425305/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746622395","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703440/881888/148410363d7e6c7959ae816a09ca8295462b5534/1750425305/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746622395","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703440/881888/148410363d7e6c7959ae816a09ca8295462b5534/1750425305/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746622395","id":257133442,"name":"Actuator_\u82f1\u8a9e","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133442/e9951c7029cd754227a6819d0d6676d8c3da613c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746622395"}],"name":"Actuator : Overt Abnormality","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU from 